        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In recognition of the impact a prolonged disability can have on income security and as a valuable supplement to the short-term disability benefits currently provided by the Company. Effective January 1, 1998 Verizon North Inc. (North Central Region) and the International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers, Local 986 agree to establish a Long-Term Disability (LTD) Plan subject to the following provisions:",
